   {"New folder name","Name of the new export folder. Use a fresh name for each project."},
   {"Separate sessions into their own folders","Keep each acquisition session in its own folder. Off combines compatible sessions into each input group."},
   {"Include matching calibration files","Export available compatible dark, flat and bias files for use in your stacking software."},
   {"Include calibrations for subs with unknown calibration state","Allow matching calibration exports for subs whose processing state is unknown. Review these files before applying calibration."},
   {"Include files marked rejected/reference","Include files normally excluded as rejected or reference frames; review them before stacking."},
   {"New telescope name","Unique saved name for this physical telescope. Renaming also updates matching indexed captures, manifests and paths in the current repository."},
