   {"Export searchable catalogue CSV","Save indexed capture metadata as a CSV catalogue for external searching or analysis."},
   {"Show selected file location","Locate the selected archive copy in Windows Explorer."},
   {"Open exported folder","Open the completed export project in Windows Explorer."},
   {"Export files","Create verified copies of the selected captures in a new export folder."},
   {"Export folder","Create the stacking project using the selected inputs and calibration options."},
   {"Search catalogue or enter a custom target","Search the bundled catalogue, select a nearby candidate or enter the intended custom target name."},
